  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{R}}=(2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}+2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}})+(2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}-2 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}) \\\\\n& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{R}}=4 \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}\n\\end{aligned}$\nAngle between $\\vec{Q}$ and $\\vec{R}$ is zero.",
    "image": null
